  "id": "BIT-golang-2026-94448",
  "summary": "Reset context tracking on consecutive template expressions in html/template",
  "details": "When a JavaScript template literal contains consecutive expressions, the context tracking state was not properly reset upon entering a new expression. We now ensure that template-literal expression entries correctly reset context variables so all subsequent regular expression literals are accurately recognized and escaped.",
